        "TENSION: one passage lists content, criterion, construct, consequential and face validity as coordinate categories of validity evidence; another passage states construct validity 'subsumes all other types of validity' and that modern validity theory treats it as 'the overarching concern...subsuming all other types of validity evidence such as content validity and criterion validity' (asserted here as subClassOf). REPAIRED: asserting ContentValidity and CriterionValidity as both subClassOf ConstructValidity AND pairwise disjoint from ConstructValidity (via the AllDisjointClasses axiom) made ContentValidity, CriterionValidity, and their subclasses unsatisfiable. The disjointness has been narrowed to no longer include ContentValidity and CriterionValidity, preserving the subsumption claim as the logically consistent account; the coordinate-disjointness claim is documented in prose only." ;
